Follow `AGENTS.md`. Before changing UI, read `DESIGN.md`,
`apps/web/component-policy.json`, `apps/web/component-catalogue.json`, and
`docs/ai-ui-build-directive.md`. Select primitives and semantic components by
intent through the policy, preserve Missa tokens and accessibility behavior,
and run `npm run check:design-system` before handoff.
